            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Cranach Catalog Finder 1.0.4

This corrective release keeps the redesigned workspace visually consistent
immediately after an in-app update.

- CSS, JavaScript, and logo URLs now include the application version, preventing
  a browser from combining the new page with files cached by an older release
- the application shell and frontend assets continue to use no-store response
  headers as a second layer of protection
- the corrected home workspace, top navigation, live search, and package panel
  were rendered and visually checked at the target Retina viewport

No catalog data, saved client work, selections, or retained downloads are
replaced by this application-only update.
]]></description>
